@startuml
actor "Application Publisher/\nLibrary Developer" as APP_PUB order 10 #LightGreen 
actor "System/Infra\n Operator" as INFRA_OP order 20 #LightGreen 
actor "Network\n Operator" as NET_OP order 30 #LightGreen 
actor "CorDapp\n User" as CORDAPP_USER order 35 #LightPink
'actor "VNode\n Operator" as VNODE_OP order 1 #LightPink 
actor "VNode\n Operator\n**Member1**" as Member1 order 1 #LightPink
actor "VNode\n Operator\n**Other active members**" as Member2 order 1 #LightPink
actor "Cluster\n Operator" as CLUSTER_OP order 2 #LightYellow 

participant "\nMGM\n Cluster\n" as MGM order 70 #LightGreen 
participant "\nMember\n Cluster\n" as MEMBER order 2 #LightCoral 
participant "\nNotary\n Cluster\n" as NOTARY order 80 #LightGreen
participant "\nPeer\n Cluster\n" as PEER order 90 #red
participant "Certificate Authority \n +OSCP" as CA order 100
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center


hide footbox


skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide unlinked

    
group Member Info data distribution
Member1 -> MGM: re-registration request(member info)
 
 alt Member1 activated
     NET_OP -> MGM: activate Member1
     MGM -> Member2: **DF_MGM_2_Member_Data_distribution** \n include: memberInfo, memberInfo hash, GroupParameters, CPIWhitelist 
     MGM -> Member1: **DF_MGM_2_Member_Data_distribution** \n include: memberInfo, memberInfo hash, GroupParameters, CPIWhitelist
|||
    else Member1 suspended
    NET_OP -> MGM: suspend Member1 
    MGM ->  Member1: update: member1 status suspended
    alt memberInfo hash changed e.g. Member1 was active and then suspended
    MGM -> Member2: **DF_MGM_2_Member_Data_distribution** \n include: memberInfo, memberInfo hash, GroupParameters, CPIWhitelist
    else memberInfo hash is unchanged i.e. Member1 status was not changed
    |||
end
    end
  ==synchronisation==
     loop Member info synchronsiation
     Member2 -> Member2: check memberInfo hash?
    Note over MGM,Member2: If member's calculated hash does not match with the MGM's, then start sync
     Member2 -> MGM: **DF_Member_2_MGM_synchronisation** \nMGM: start Sync
     MGM -> Member2: send list of missing MemberInfos
   end
@enduml